@host = http://localhost:5177

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### List countries
GET {{host}}/api/countries

### List cities of a country
GET {{host}}/api/countries/ID/cities

### Unknown country (200 with an empty list)
GET {{host}}/api/countries/ZZ/cities

### Current weather (needs a configured OpenWeatherMap key)
GET {{host}}/api/weather/Jakarta

### Create a weather note
POST {{host}}/api/weather/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cityName": "Jakarta",
  "note": "Humid and cloudy this morning"
}

### Validation error (400, empty note)
POST {{host}}/api/weather/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cityName": "Jakarta",
}

### Unknown city (404)
POST {{host}}/api/weather/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cityName": "Atlantis",
  "note": "Does not exist"
}

